  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Agua, Saneamiento y Drenaje para Cartagena de Indias</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water, Sanitation and Sewerage Program for Cartagena de Indias</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a reducir la vulnerabilidad de los habitantes de Cartagena ante eventos climticos. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar el acceso a servicios de drenaje; (ii) contribuir con la gestin adecuada de los Residuos Slidos Urbanos (RSU) promoviendo la participacin de la poblacin local y migrante; (iii) incrementar y mejorar el acceso a servicios de agua potable y saneamiento; y (iv) fortalecer las capacidades de la Alcalda para generar ingresos propios.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program is to contribute to reducing the vulnerability of the inhabitants of Cartagena de Indias to flood events and inadequate sanitary conditions in a fiscally sustainable manner. The specific objectives are: (i) to increase access to urban drainage services for both the local and migrant populations; (ii) to increase access to and improve the quality of drinking water services for both the local and migrant populations, and to increase access to sanitation services; and (iii) to strengthen the Municipality&apos;s capacity to generate its own revenue.</narrative>
  </description>
